WEBVTT

2
00:00:35.949 --> 00:00:40.834
Sorry I crashed the cart, guys.
I swear I saw something coming right at us.

3
00:00:40.954 --> 00:00:42.369
That was the road, Panicky.

4
00:00:42.489 --> 00:00:44.489
Hey, Hefty! How's it looking?

5
00:00:45.025 --> 00:00:48.859
Lookin' good. Nice size. Excellent definition.

6
00:00:49.029 --> 00:00:51.029
Not your muscles. The wheel.

7
00:00:51.898 --> 00:00:53.146
That's busted.

8
00:00:53.266 --> 00:00:55.182
We're all gonna die!

9
00:00:55.302 --> 00:00:59.253
Maybe. Or we could all camp out here,
walk back home in the morning.

10
00:00:59.373 --> 00:01:02.489
Hey! Why don't we tell ghost stories?

11
00:01:02.609 --> 00:01:03.957
Are you out of your mind?

12
00:01:04.077 --> 00:01:06.637
You want to tell me a ghost...

13
00:01:07.214 --> 00:01:08.662
Hey. How ya doin'?

14
00:01:08.782 --> 00:01:10.731
Ghosts aren't real, Panicky.

15
00:01:10.851 --> 00:01:12.851
Or are they?

16
00:01:16.556 --> 00:01:18.338
It's even scarier out there!

17
00:01:18.458 --> 00:01:21.008
Okay. Who said that?
- Yeah, who's there?

18
00:01:21.128 --> 00:01:23.722
It's a ghost!
- No, I'm not a ghost.

19
00:01:23.864 --> 00:01:28.353
It's that guy with the big voice.
He always says what just happened.

20
00:01:28.668 --> 00:01:29.983
That's Narrator Smurf to you!

21
00:01:30.103 --> 00:01:34.054
Yeah, that's you. How you doin'?
- I'm doing quite well, thank you.

22
00:01:34.174 --> 00:01:36.990
And if it is a ghost story you seek,

23
00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:40.807
I know one that is smurfsolutely true.

24
00:01:42.949 --> 00:01:45.440
It's just the nerves.

25
00:01:46.753 --> 00:01:48.035
Help me!

26
00:01:48.155 --> 00:01:52.990
The story takes place beyond
the old covered bridge,

27
00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:58.223
in a place no Smurf in their right mind
would dare to enter,

28
00:01:58.398 --> 00:02:03.450
and where a vengeful, restless spirit
is trapped forever.

29
00:02:03.570 --> 00:02:06.920
You mean the Headless Smurfman?
I mean, the Smurfless Headman?

30
00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:08.021
Yes.

31
00:02:08.141 --> 00:02:10.141
The Headless Horseman.

32
00:02:10.677 --> 00:02:14.628
Excuse me, the Headless Horseman,
that ain't real. No disrespect.

33
00:02:14.748 --> 00:02:16.363
Oh, but it is.

34
00:02:16.483 --> 00:02:19.066
There are some Smurfs
who have actually seen him.

35
00:02:19.186 --> 00:02:21.468
Oh, yeah? Who?
- Yeah! Who?

36
00:02:21.588 --> 00:02:26.992
You mean you don't know
the Legend of Smurfy Hollow?

37
00:02:31.598 --> 00:02:35.830
The story begins the year
of the Golden Harvest.

38
00:02:36.036 --> 00:02:42.100
The Smurfs were celebrating the arrival
of autumn with games, music and dance.

39
00:02:43.710 --> 00:02:46.193
Gather around, Smurfs.

40
00:02:46.313 --> 00:02:48.895
It's time for the event
you've all been waiting for...

41
00:02:49.015 --> 00:02:51.164
The fashion show?

42
00:02:51.284 --> 00:02:53.912
Hey! Stop foraging in my harvest hat!

43
00:02:54.588 --> 00:02:58.854
No, Vanity. It's time for the Smurfberry Hunt!

44
00:03:00.193 --> 00:03:02.576
The rules are the same as every year.

45
00:03:02.696 --> 00:03:07.190
The Smurf who brings back the most
smurfberries before sundown wins!

46
00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:09.883
Sorry, I didn't catch what she said.

47
00:03:10.003 --> 00:03:13.520
I'm having trouble hearing her over
the clanging of these victory medals

48
00:03:13.640 --> 00:03:16.623
that I'm wearing from the past nine years
of smurfberry hunts.

49
00:03:16.743 --> 00:03:20.761
Yeah, joke it up, laddy, because
this is the year I'm going to win.

50
00:03:20.881 --> 00:03:23.441
Ha, ha, ha, and ha!

51
00:03:23.650 --> 00:03:28.368
That is the sound of me scoffing
at the very notion of that impossibility.

52
00:03:28.488 --> 00:03:30.604
Reporter Smurf with the Smurfington Post.

53
00:03:30.724 --> 00:03:33.540
Brainy, you've won nine times in a row.

54
00:03:33.660 --> 00:03:36.877
Do you think anyone has even
a smurf of a chance against you?

55
00:03:36.997 --> 00:03:39.945
Good question.
Let me survey the competition.

56
00:03:40.367 --> 00:03:42.149
No.

57
00:03:42.269 --> 00:03:46.486
Looks like you'll all be treated
to a new Brainy victory dance this year

58
00:03:46.606 --> 00:03:49.222
as I am officially retiring the smurfomotion.

59
00:03:49.342 --> 00:03:51.537
Go, Brainy!
- You're the best!

60
00:03:51.778 --> 00:03:53.093
You're too kind!

61
00:03:53.213 --> 00:03:54.628
Thank you for your adulation!
- You're awesome!

62
00:03:54.748 --> 00:03:56.863
Crikey, what a showoff!

63
00:03:56.983 --> 00:04:00.600
It just doesn't make any sense,
him winning all these years.

64
00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:05.544
I'm bigger, stronger, braver,
and I don't wear any pants to slow me down.

65
00:04:05.792 --> 00:04:09.276
There's something rotten
in the state of Den-smurf,

66
00:04:09.396 --> 00:04:11.545
and I'm gonna get to the bottom of it.

67
00:04:11.665 --> 00:04:13.929
Let the games begin!

68
00:04:28.848 --> 00:04:32.399
Look, over there.
- Holy Smurf, look at these berries.

69
00:04:35.655 --> 00:04:38.146
How's it going, Greedy?
- Good!

70
00:04:38.391 --> 00:04:40.807
Hey there, Lazy!
- Hey!

71
00:04:40.927 --> 00:04:42.927
One!

72
00:04:43.196 --> 00:04:45.196
I'm exhausted.

73
00:04:47.934 --> 00:04:49.316
Easy there, Clueless Smurf.

74
00:04:49.436 --> 00:04:52.886
That there's the old covered bridge
that leads to Smurfy Hollow!

75
00:04:53.006 --> 00:04:57.238
The Headless Horseman lives over there!
- Oh, I had no clue.

76
00:04:57.444 --> 00:04:59.605
No one tells me anything.

77
00:05:15.895 --> 00:05:17.895
There we go. Much better.

78
00:05:18.999 --> 00:05:20.999
Smurfy Hollow?

79
00:05:22.202 --> 00:05:24.202
I hate this spooky stuff.

80
00:05:25.538 --> 00:05:27.053
Come on, Gutsy.

81
00:05:27.173 --> 00:05:30.199
Your name is Gutsy, for Smurf's sake.

82
00:05:35.348 --> 00:05:37.839
Why did it have to be bats?

83
00:05:44.357 --> 00:05:46.357
Cripes...

84
00:06:02.275 --> 00:06:03.390
Great Smurf!

85
00:06:03.510 --> 00:06:05.859
He has his own secret stash!

86
00:06:05.979 --> 00:06:11.076
He's been coming here every year,
hogging all the bounty for himself!

87
00:06:11.351 --> 00:06:14.514
The very notion of a Headless Horseman...

88
00:06:14.888 --> 00:06:19.325
How would he navigate? He has no senses!

89
00:06:19.459 --> 00:06:22.542
And if it rains,
wouldn't his body fill with water?

90
00:06:22.662 --> 00:06:25.345
The other Smurfs don't know
how to think these things through.

91
00:06:25.465 --> 00:06:28.547
Year after year,
he's been making a fool of me!

92
00:06:34.641 --> 00:06:38.737
But I've got an idea
that's gonna put him right!

93
00:06:41.381 --> 00:06:44.195
Just one more bucket, then I'm going home!

94
00:06:44.617 --> 00:06:46.617
What was that?

95
00:06:48.288 --> 00:06:53.112
Must have been a dead tree branch.
It's quite common in windy conditions.

96
00:06:54.427 --> 00:06:59.694
Just relax, Brainy.
It must be a harmless animal,

97
00:07:00.300 --> 00:07:06.432
maybe, like, a toothless field mouse
or a legless weasel, or a...

98
00:07:07.807 --> 00:07:09.055
What?

99
00:07:09.175 --> 00:07:11.175
A tall zebra?

100
00:07:11.745 --> 00:07:16.341
No! Horseman! I'm the Headless Horseman!

101
00:07:17.417 --> 00:07:20.580
No, no, no, no! It can't be!

102
00:07:27.260 --> 00:07:29.260
He's totally buying it!

103
00:07:39.272 --> 00:07:40.754
I've been pumpkined!

104
00:07:40.874 --> 00:07:42.874
It worked!

105
00:07:43.543 --> 00:07:45.543
It's a berry bonanza!

106
00:07:46.813 --> 00:07:49.611
Whose medal will be clankin' now?

107
00:07:49.816 --> 00:07:53.466
That's right, little smurfberry!
I've won fair and square!

108
00:07:53.586 --> 00:07:55.368
Or at least, square.

109
00:07:55.488 --> 00:07:59.424
What's that? Brainy?
Oh, don't you worry, he'll be fine.

110
00:08:08.501 --> 00:08:10.501
My glasses!

111
00:08:17.210 --> 00:08:20.360
It seems my frenzied sprinting
and hysterical shrieking

112
00:08:20.480 --> 00:08:22.328
was a shrewd course of action.

113
00:08:22.448 --> 00:08:24.793
It definitely smurfed me to safety.

114
00:08:29.589 --> 00:08:33.685
Oh, boy!
This cage has Gargamel written all over it.

115
00:08:36.329 --> 00:08:40.698
All right, Smurfs!
The Smurfberry Hunt is officially over!

116
00:08:41.301 --> 00:08:44.050
Lazy, how many smurfberries did you get?

117
00:08:44.170 --> 00:08:46.170
I have one.

118
00:08:46.806 --> 00:08:50.003
Very good. That's two more than last year!

119
00:08:50.844 --> 00:08:52.525
And what did you get, Vanity?

120
00:08:52.645 --> 00:08:54.294
Even handsomer...

121
00:08:54.414 --> 00:08:56.414
Hey! You again! Bad goat!

122
00:08:57.083 --> 00:08:59.532
Stop it! Not my cornucopia.

123
00:08:59.652 --> 00:09:02.621
And you, Greedy? How many did you get?

124
00:09:03.623 --> 00:09:05.623
A lot.

125
00:09:08.228 --> 00:09:11.391
Brainy! You've outdone yourself this year!

126
00:09:11.564 --> 00:09:13.346
Think again, Papa.

127
00:09:13.466 --> 00:09:14.681
Gutsy?
- Yes!

128
00:09:14.801 --> 00:09:17.079
How do you like them smurfberries?

129
00:09:18.538 --> 00:09:21.439
Well, this is unexpected.

130
00:09:21.641 --> 00:09:25.959
Consmurfulations, Gutsy!
- This is unbelievable.

131
00:09:26.079 --> 00:09:29.863
Gutsy has won the Smurfberry Hunt!
Gutsy has won the Smurfberry Hunt!

132
00:09:29.983 --> 00:09:31.531
We have a new champion!

133
00:09:31.651 --> 00:09:34.620
That's right. And how about a victory dance?

134
00:09:34.787 --> 00:09:38.004
Gutsy! Gutsy!
- Thank you!

135
00:09:38.124 --> 00:09:40.888
Who's on top and who's on bottom now?

136
00:09:41.194 --> 00:09:44.644
Good for you, Gutsy!
You've truly earned this year's medal!

137
00:09:44.764 --> 00:09:47.113
Yeah, of course I did.

138
00:09:47.233 --> 00:09:49.816
Why did you say it like that?
- Like what?

139
00:09:49.936 --> 00:09:51.885
Nothing.
- Hey, wait a minute!

140
00:09:52.005 --> 00:09:53.520
What is it, Suspicious Smurf?

141
00:09:53.640 --> 00:09:55.555
Where's Brainy?

142
00:09:55.675 --> 00:09:59.042
It's not like the reigning champ
to not show up.

143
00:09:59.178 --> 00:10:01.728
That's very strange indeed.

144
00:10:01.848 --> 00:10:04.731
You don't think something happened
to him out in the forest, do you?

145
00:10:04.851 --> 00:10:07.100
Do you think he got lost?
- What if he fell in a ditch?

146
00:10:07.220 --> 00:10:09.068
Maybe a legless weasel got him.

147
00:10:09.188 --> 00:10:14.741
You know what, I think I might have
spotted Brainy in the woods earlier.

148
00:10:14.861 --> 00:10:18.763
I'll go and see if he needs help
with his baskets, shall I?

149
00:10:18.898 --> 00:10:21.389
Off I go. See you.

150
00:10:25.538 --> 00:10:29.255
Oh, for Smurf's sake, why did he have
to run away like that?

151
00:10:29.375 --> 00:10:31.375
Come on, Brainy!
- Hey, Gutsy!

152
00:10:31.577 --> 00:10:32.892
I mean...

153
00:10:33.012 --> 00:10:35.357
Hey, what are you doing here, lass?

154
00:10:35.481 --> 00:10:37.530
I thought I'd help you look for Brainy.

155
00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:39.299
Where'd you see him, exactly?

156
00:10:39.419 --> 00:10:44.404
Oh, you know, he was just over there...
- By Smurfy Rock?

157
00:10:44.524 --> 00:10:49.393
No, no, more... You know, that way...
- By Smurfy Creek?

158
00:10:49.562 --> 00:10:53.054
No, not Smurfy Creek... More...

159
00:10:57.904 --> 00:10:59.619
Why are you looking at me like that?

160
00:10:59.739 --> 00:11:02.889
Stop grilling me, woman!
I can't take it anymore!

161
00:11:03.009 --> 00:11:05.525
It was just a wee little prank, that's all.

162
00:11:05.645 --> 00:11:07.594
A prank? What kind of prank?

163
00:11:07.714 --> 00:11:10.430
It may have involved a fake
Headless Horseman...

164
00:11:10.550 --> 00:11:12.732
What?
- I only wanted to teach him a lesson.

165
00:11:12.852 --> 00:11:16.369
But he ran off like a banshee
into Smurfy Hollow and...

166
00:11:16.489 --> 00:11:19.890
Brainy is in Smurfy Hollow? Alone?

167
00:11:20.526 --> 00:11:22.475
It's almost dark. Come on!

168
00:11:22.595 --> 00:11:26.079
I never should have gotten out
of bed this morning...

169
00:11:26.566 --> 00:11:30.586
Assuming a wooden bar has
a circumference of 18 smurfimeters,

170
00:11:31.637 --> 00:11:34.987
the force required to snap it
would be precisely...

171
00:11:39.979 --> 00:11:43.529
Gutsy! Smurfette!
- Oh, my Smurf, Brainy! Are you okay?

172
00:11:43.649 --> 00:11:47.600
Well, I'm trapped 30 feet in the air
in a sinister Gargamelian cage.

173
00:11:47.720 --> 00:11:50.603
This is not what "okay" looks like.
- Yes, come on, come on.

174
00:11:50.723 --> 00:11:53.473
Let's get him down from there
and get out of this creepy forest.

175
00:11:53.593 --> 00:11:55.909
Hold on, Gutsy.
We need to think this through.

176
00:11:56.029 --> 00:11:59.579
Yes, a classic Gargamel tactic is
to set additional traps around...

177
00:11:59.699 --> 00:12:01.681
We don't have time to overthink this!

178
00:12:01.801 --> 00:12:03.962
Gutsy!

179
00:12:06.272 --> 00:12:09.400
Now we've got plenty of time
to overthink this.

180
00:12:09.842 --> 00:12:13.493
Do you think Papa's looking for us?
- Not in Smurfy Hollow.

181
00:12:13.613 --> 00:12:18.498
I hate to further complicate things, guys,
but the Headless Horseman is out there.

182
00:12:18.618 --> 00:12:23.681
Searching. Without senses.
I know it defies all rational explanations.

183
00:12:23.856 --> 00:12:26.086
Gutsy?
- Okay, fine.

184
00:12:28.494 --> 00:12:32.521
Yeah, he tricked you!
- Sorry.

185
00:12:33.332 --> 00:12:34.647
This is all your fault!

186
00:12:34.767 --> 00:12:36.916
It's not all my fault!

187
00:12:37.036 --> 00:12:41.054
I'm not the one sneakin' around,
keeping all the smurfberries for myself.

188
00:12:41.174 --> 00:12:43.734
Why you...
- What was that?

189
00:12:45.078 --> 00:12:47.078
It's Azrael.

190
00:12:59.826 --> 00:13:01.574
He's going to get Gargamel!

191
00:13:01.694 --> 00:13:03.876
Oh, boy. What are we going to do?

192
00:13:03.996 --> 00:13:08.433
Listen, guys. I have an idea.
But it's gonna take guts and brains.

193
00:13:09.502 --> 00:13:12.300
Do you think you two could work together?

194
00:13:15.274 --> 00:13:20.041
Just one drop. I've got to be very precise.

195
00:13:20.580 --> 00:13:22.695
Two drops would be bad.

196
00:13:22.815 --> 00:13:24.731
Three drops...

197
00:13:24.851 --> 00:13:27.732
I don't even know
what three drops would do.

198
00:13:33.226 --> 00:13:35.839
Azrael! Can't you see that I'm working?

199
00:13:39.232 --> 00:13:42.724
Control yourself.
Get off of me, you frenzied feline!

200
00:13:45.905 --> 00:13:48.066
What did you say? How many?

201
00:13:49.842 --> 00:13:55.508
Three! Excellent! Excellent!
You wait here. You'll only get in my way!

202
00:14:02.121 --> 00:14:03.903
I don't know where they are.
Are you coming?

203
00:14:04.023 --> 00:14:09.342
Gutsy, do you have enough momentum?
- Aye, Smurfette! I'm giving it all she's got.

204
00:14:09.462 --> 00:14:11.911
Brainy, we need perfect coordination.

205
00:14:12.031 --> 00:14:16.916
Yes! Gutsy, it's crucial that you shift
your weight at exactly T minus zero.

206
00:14:17.036 --> 00:14:20.870
And when is that?
- Just about now!

207
00:14:25.912 --> 00:14:28.928
It's working! It's also making me sick!

208
00:14:29.048 --> 00:14:31.278
Brace yourselves!

209
00:14:39.025 --> 00:14:41.674
Oh, no, Smurfette is still up there!

210
00:14:41.794 --> 00:14:44.811
It's okay. We still have time
before Gargamel shows up.

211
00:14:44.931 --> 00:14:46.931
Azrael!

212
00:14:47.066 --> 00:14:49.066
Come on!

213
00:14:51.237 --> 00:14:53.649
Do you even know where you're going?

214
00:14:57.343 --> 00:14:59.777
Hello, Smurfs!

215
00:15:00.780 --> 00:15:03.629
Wait. I thought you said
there were three Smurfs.

216
00:15:03.749 --> 00:15:05.749
Go look for the other two!

217
00:15:08.721 --> 00:15:11.417
Why hello, my dear daughter.

218
00:15:12.658 --> 00:15:15.821
Finally, we meet again, eh?

219
00:15:16.162 --> 00:15:19.598
I always knew you would be
returned to me someday.

220
00:15:20.299 --> 00:15:23.916
You know, there's this magical
new device called a toothbrush!

221
00:15:24.036 --> 00:15:28.154
My grooming is perfectly up to 16th century
standards. Thank you very much!

222
00:15:28.274 --> 00:15:31.190
Hey, Gargasmell!
- There's a nose on your wart!

223
00:15:31.310 --> 00:15:33.310
Why you!

224
00:15:35.047 --> 00:15:37.047
Not bad!

225
00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:40.214
Come on! Now's your chance!

226
00:15:43.689 --> 00:15:45.689
Come here!

227
00:15:47.426 --> 00:15:49.519
Stop! I'm horribly ticklish!

228
00:15:58.337 --> 00:16:00.686
What do we do?
- I think we might be done here.

229
00:16:00.806 --> 00:16:04.298
Goodbye!
It was an honor smurfing with you.

230
00:16:07.780 --> 00:16:09.975
Azrael, what is that?

231
00:16:11.117 --> 00:16:13.608
What? What is a Hairless Horseman?

232
00:16:14.654 --> 00:16:16.269
Oh, Headless.

233
00:16:16.389 --> 00:16:18.389
Headless!

234
00:16:18.858 --> 00:16:21.383
Crikey! He really does exist!

235
00:16:26.666 --> 00:16:29.100
Wizards and children first!

236
00:16:30.970 --> 00:16:33.181
He's gaining on us! We're doomed!

237
00:16:34.874 --> 00:16:39.592
No, we're not! The legend says
the Horseman is trapped in the Hollow!

238
00:16:39.712 --> 00:16:41.394
Since when do you believe in legends?

239
00:16:41.514 --> 00:16:44.297
Since they started chasing me
with flaming pumpkins...

240
00:16:44.417 --> 00:16:47.533
So you're saying...
- lf we can get to the bridge, we're safe!

241
00:16:47.653 --> 00:16:49.468
Brilliant! You're a genius!

242
00:16:49.588 --> 00:16:52.004
We're never going to make it!
- Yes, we will!

243
00:16:52.124 --> 00:16:54.273
But we need better transportation!

244
00:16:54.393 --> 00:16:56.393
I got you, laddy!

245
00:16:58.631 --> 00:17:01.293
Come on! Climb aboard the red-eye!

246
00:17:07.740 --> 00:17:09.740
Nice work, Smurfs.

247
00:17:23.989 --> 00:17:25.238
We did it!

248
00:17:25.358 --> 00:17:29.055
Azrael, look at that!
He can't exit the Hollow!

249
00:17:30.196 --> 00:17:33.324
What's the matter? Scared?

250
00:17:33.833 --> 00:17:39.271
"Oh, I'm such a tough ghost!
I can't even cross a tiny little bridge!"

251
00:17:42.141 --> 00:17:44.141
What's that for?

252
00:17:51.817 --> 00:17:53.817
Azrael!

253
00:17:57.423 --> 00:18:01.189
Get off of me! Let go, you foul furball!

254
00:18:01.527 --> 00:18:04.462
What? What is a "water-ball"?

255
00:18:11.170 --> 00:18:14.298
Azrael, are you dead?

256
00:18:18.244 --> 00:18:20.726
I'm starting to like that Horseman.

257
00:18:20.846 --> 00:18:24.030
Especially when he's riding away.

258
00:18:24.150 --> 00:18:28.143
There you are!
We were getting worried about you.

259
00:18:28.788 --> 00:18:32.138
Now, Gutsy, are you ready
to receive your medal?

260
00:18:32.258 --> 00:18:36.490
That's nice and all
but I think Brainy should have it.

261
00:18:37.430 --> 00:18:41.161
Look, Brainy.
I just want to say I'm sorry.

262
00:18:41.400 --> 00:18:43.215
For scaring you like that and all.

263
00:18:43.335 --> 00:18:47.586
It's just... I tried so hard every year,
and you always won.

264
00:18:47.706 --> 00:18:49.455
I'm sorry, too.

265
00:18:49.575 --> 00:18:52.325
I shouldn't have kept all those
smurfberries a secret.

266
00:18:52.445 --> 00:18:56.862
And I may have gotten carried away
with the whole winning thing.

267
00:18:56.982 --> 00:18:58.397
Seems to me, laddy,

268
00:18:58.517 --> 00:19:03.784
that we let winning a medal get in the way
of what's really important here.

269
00:19:04.156 --> 00:19:06.272
Family.
- That's true.

270
00:19:06.392 --> 00:19:09.475
See, you guys,
when the two of you help each other,

271
00:19:09.595 --> 00:19:11.944
well, that's what family is all about.

272
00:19:12.064 --> 00:19:13.679
Still, you should have it.

273
00:19:13.799 --> 00:19:16.482
Negative, I have not exactly been playing fair.

274
00:19:16.602 --> 00:19:18.617
No, come on now, lad!
- No, you won.

275
00:19:18.737 --> 00:19:19.885
You should have it.
- You take it!

276
00:19:20.005 --> 00:19:22.321
No, it has to be you!
- No, it has to be you!

277
00:19:22.441 --> 00:19:25.467
You...
- Just take it!

278
00:19:27.379 --> 00:19:29.395
Lazy?

279
00:19:29.515 --> 00:19:30.696
I win!

280
00:19:30.816 --> 00:19:35.735
Lazy, how does it feel to be
this year's Smurfberry Hunt champion?

281
00:19:35.855 --> 00:19:37.855
Exhausting!

282
00:19:40.192 --> 00:19:42.805
Come here, ya big sook!
- Okay, Gutsy...

283
00:19:43.596 --> 00:19:47.259
I love this wee little lad!
- That's a little much...

284
00:19:47.433 --> 00:19:49.281
Too much momentum!

285
00:19:49.401 --> 00:19:50.916
Very nice.

286
00:19:51.036 --> 00:19:54.062
Hey, Drummer Smurf, give me a beat.

287
00:20:11.390 --> 00:20:16.418
Good job getting them home safe.
I guess I should change you back now.

288
00:20:19.899 --> 00:20:21.814
You must be hungry.

289
00:20:21.934 --> 00:20:24.994
Okay, let's go find Vanity's hat.

290
00:20:27.039 --> 00:20:29.735
So the Headless Horseman was a goat?

291
00:20:29.975 --> 00:20:33.467
Well, sure, I mean,
what else could it have been?

292
00:20:34.079 --> 00:20:36.095
Just to set the record straight,

293
00:20:36.215 --> 00:20:39.742
Hefty was completely unscared
the entire situation.

294
00:20:40.286 --> 00:20:41.967
Really?

295
00:20:42.087 --> 00:20:45.386
Not scared. Not even one little...

296
00:20:45.824 --> 00:20:47.824
Hold me!

297
00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:50.524
It's just a bat, Hefty.

298
00:20:50.696 --> 00:20:52.696
Hey! Give a guy a break.
